      "trend": "Research has been focused on understanding the effects of short-range order (SRO) and other microstructural features on the thermal and mechanical properties of high-entropy alloys (HEAs). Studies have shown that SRO can influence dislocation mobility, leading to changes in strength and ductility. Additionally, the use of refractory elements and the control of precipitation structures have been explored to improve the high-temperature properties of HEAs.",
